mhfwupdater (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release. Writes microHAM firmware files (*.cbl) to micro KEYER,
    CW KEYER, DIGI KEYER, micro KEYER II, micro KEYER III, DIGI KEYER II,
    micro KEYER 2R/2R+, micro 2R, Station Master and Station Master DeLuxe.
  * Tested on micro KEYER III and DIGI KEYER II.

